<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Hoi An Guide: 11 places – lanterns, cao lầu, My Son &amp; hidden gems – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hoi-an/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>3. Bánh mì Phượng</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hoi-an/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>108.33201,15.87848,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Cao Lầu</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hoi-an/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>108.32814,15.8784,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Old-town lanes, assembly halls &amp; Tan Ky House</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Set off at 6–7 a.m., then the lanes are empty and golden. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hoi-an/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>108.32399,15.87795,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. An Bang Beach</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Cycle there and stay for sunset. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hoi-an/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>108.34032,15.91166,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. White rose, mì Quảng &amp; more: eating in Hoi An</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Eat where locals sit – and ask the price. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hoi-an/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>108.32501,15.88296,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Trà Quế – vegetable village &amp; cooking class</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Book a cooking class with a village visit in the morning. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hoi-an/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>108.33773,15.90218,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Cẩm Thanh – coconut forest &amp; basket boats</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Come in the morning and agree the price beforehand. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hoi-an/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>108.36181,15.88952,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. My Son – Cham temples</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Start early in the morning before the buses arrive. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hoi-an/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>108.124,15.764,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
